<title>DENMARK: Danish Realkredit six-month 1997 profit doubles.</title>
<headline>Danish Realkredit six-month 1997 profit doubles.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>					 (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group pre-tax result	     1,266  vs  647</p>
<p> Group net result		     834  vs  584</p>
<p> Securities and forex results     387  vs  -64</p>
<p> Losses and bad debt provisions    23  vs -105</p>
<p> Balance end-June 1997	   344,296 vs 336,528 end-June 1996</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Denmark's second biggest mortgage credit firm is Realkredit Danmark A/S. It said in a statement that expected a full year 1997 pre-tax profit of around two billion crowns.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33-969652</p>
</text>
